    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Trippy's Disc Golf, an open world disc golf experience where you can explore a map and throw discs from wherever to wherever you like!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Trippy's Disc Golf, you'll be able to explore several maps as they are built out and added to the game, seeing vastly different maps, ranging from a casual little forest with a cute village nearby, or play disc golf around an active volcano! Maps are still being made and will be included at no charge to people who have purchased the game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs with maps, you will have a variety of discs to choose from, with more coming out after release for free to the user!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith dynamic weather, a sun that moves based on your real time, and lanterns that light up at appropriate hours, we hope that this game is a little immersive, so that you can enjoy the sights to behold in the environment, as beautiful god-rays pierce the clouds and shadows are cast by the trees.",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to Trippy's Disc Golf, an open world disc golf experience where you can explore a map and throw discs from wherever to wherever you like!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Trippy's Disc Golf, you'll be able to explore several maps as they are built out and added to the game, seeing vastly different maps, ranging from a casual little forest with a cute village nearby, or play disc golf around an active volcano! Maps are still being made and will be included at no charge to people who have purchased the game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs with maps, you will have a variety of discs to choose from, with more coming out after release for free to the user!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith dynamic weather, a sun that moves based on your real time, and lanterns that light up at appropriate hours, we hope that this game is a little immersive, so that you can enjoy the sights to behold in the environment, as beautiful god-rays pierce the clouds and shadows are cast by the trees.",
    "short_description": "Trippy's Disc Golf: Immerse yourself in an open-world environment and conquer challenging courses. Throw discs, master precision, and explore handcrafted landscapes.",
